    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ringer is a marble-inspired roguelike deck builder focused on combining various marbles to score big!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ringer combines the age-old game of shooting marbles into a ring with the modern deckbuilding genre.\u00a0Try your best to combine various marbles to score the maximum amount every round!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get marbles into the ring to score, but watch out! Enemy cannons will try and knock your marbles out!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00a0<br>Plan ahead and use the shop to purchase what you need for victory. Use one-time power marbles to tip the odds in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0<br>Can you reach the final boss? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ringer is a marble-inspired roguelike deck builder focused on combining various marbles to score big!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ringer combines the age-old game of shooting marbles into a ring with the modern deckbuilding genre.\u00a0Try your best to combine various marbles to score the maximum amount every round!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get marbles into the ring to score, but watch out! Enemy cannons will try and knock your marbles out!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00a0<br>Plan ahead and use the shop to purchase what you need for victory. Use one-time power marbles to tip the odds in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0<br>Can you reach the final boss? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
